OL,3,GNEWSASmell leads police to discover    
OL,4,A'substantial' cannabis factory         
OL,6,FPolice in Portadown have uncovered a   
OL,7,F"substantial" cannabis factory after   
OL,8,Fnoting a strong smell of the drug in   
OL,9,Fthe area.                              
OL,11,FTwo men were arrested following the    
OL,12,Fdiscovery of the premises in the Annagh
OL,13,FHill industrial estate on Wednesday    
OL,14,Fmorning.                               
OL,16,FUpon investigation, police discovered  
OL,17,Fan operation spanning three floors and 
OL,18,Fcontaining plants with an estimated    
OL,19,Fstreet value of #200,000.              
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
