OL,3,GNEWSASmell leads police to discover    
OL,4,A'substantial' cannabis factory         
OL,6,FTwo men, aged 32 and 27, located inside
OL,7,Fthe property were arrested on suspicion
OL,8,Fof a range of drugs offences, including
OL,9,Fcannabis cultivation and possession of 
OL,10,Fclass B controlled drugs with intent to
OL,11,Fsupply.                                
